Now CSS. Add touch styles before responsive media query, and adjust responsive. Also `#scene{touch-action:none}` and `body{touch-action:none; overscroll-behavior:none}`. Note body touch-action none prevents page scroll (game fixed). Good.

Touch styles design:

```css
/* ---------- touch controls ---------- */
body.touch-mode{cursor:default}
#scene{touch-action:none}
body.touch-mode #quest-tracker, body.touch-mode #minimap-wrap, body.touch-mode #hotbar-wrap{display:none!important}
body.touch-mode #sound-toggle{right:calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-right));bottom:auto;top:76px}
body.touch-mode #toasts{right:12px;top:118px;bottom:auto;max-width:min(280px,60vw)}
body.touch-mode #toasts .toast{font-size:12.5px;padding:7px 12px}
body.touch-mode #interact-prompt{bottom:calc(22px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
body.touch-mode #objective-toast{top:58px;font-size:10.5px;max-width:70vw}
body.touch-mode .hotbar-hint{display:none}
#touch-controls{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:24;font-family:"Cinzel",serif;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none}
#joystick-zone{position:absolute;left:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-left));bottom:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));width:clamp(100px,26vw,138px);height:clamp(100px,26vw,138px);pointer-events:auto;touch-action:none}
#joystick-base{position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(217,185,120,.28);background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 46%,rgba(28,21,48,.55),rgba(10,8,18,.32));box-shadow:inset 0 0 24px rgba(154,123,224,.15),0 8px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.35);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);transition:border-color .15s,background .15s}
#joystick-base::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:17%;border-radius:50%;border:1px dashed rgba(217,185,120,.18)}
#joystick-knob{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:38%;height:38%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(245,223,166,.55);background:radial-gradient(circle at 38% 32%,rgba(120,92,180,.95),rgba(28,21,48,.95));box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(154,123,224,.45),0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.5);transition:transform .06s linear}
#joystick-zone.active #joystick-base{border-color:rgba(245,223,166,.55);background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 46%,rgba(42,31,72,.7),rgba(10,8,18,.42))}
.joy-label{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:-15px;transform:translateX(-50%);font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.28em;color:rgba(217,185,120,.45)}
#touch-actions{position:absolute;right:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-right));bottom:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:7px;pointer-events:none}
.touch-mana{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:min(210px,48vw);pointer-events:none;margin-bottom:1px}
.touch-mana span{font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#8f83a8}
.touch-mana-track{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
#touch-mana-fill{height:100%;width:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4d7fd0,#86c8ff);box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(120,185,255,.7);transition:width .15s}
.touch-cast-row,.touch-util-row{display:flex;gap:7px;pointer-events:auto}
.touch-btn{position:relative;width:clamp(44px,10.5vw,56px);height:clamp(44px,10.5vw,56px);border-radius:14px;border:1px solid rgba(217,185,120,.32);background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 38%,rgba(45,32,74,.92),rgba(11,8,20,.94));display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--cat,var(--gold));box-shadow:0 7px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.45),inset 0 0 18px rgba(255,255,255,.03);touch-action:none;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;transition:transform .08s,border-color .12s,box-shadow .12s}
.touch-btn .tb-icon{font-size:clamp(18px,4.4vw,23px);line-height:1;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 8px currentColor);pointer-events:none}
.touch-btn .tb-key{position:absolute;top:2px;left:5px;font-size:7.5px;color:rgba(217,185,120,.6);pointer-events:none}
.touch-btn .tb-label{position:absolute;bottom:3px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#cfc2ab;pointer-events:none}
.touch-btn.util{width:clamp(40px,9vw,48px);height:clamp(40px,9vw,48px);border-radius:50%;color:var(--gold)}
.touch-btn.util .tb-icon{font-size:clamp(15px,3.6vw,18px)}
.touch-btn.cast.category-offensive{--cat:#ff8a66}.touch-btn.cast.category-defensive{--cat:#78b9ff}.touch-btn.cast.category-healing{--cat:#78e6a8}.touch-btn.cast.category-elemental{--cat:#ffc266}.touch-btn.cast.category-transformation{--cat:#c79bff}.touch-btn.cast.category-forbidden{--cat:#ff5f7a}
.touch-btn.empty{opacity:.32;border-style:dashed}
.touch-btn.pressed,.touch-btn:active{transform:scale(.92);border-color:var(--gold-bright);box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(217,185,120,.35)}
.touch-btn.ready{border-color:var(--gold-bright);box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(217,185,120,.55);animation:touchPulse 1.1s infinite}
@keyframes touchPulse{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(217,185,120,.35)}50%{box-shadow:0 0 26px rgba(217,185,120,.7)}}
.touch-btn .tb-cd{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:inherit;background:rgba(5,4,10,.65);font-size:13px;color:#e8d5a8;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
.touch-btn.cooling .tb-cd{opacity:1}
body.in-duel #touch-interact{display:none}
body.touch-mode #dialogue{bottom:calc(88px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}
body.dialogue-open #touch-controls{opacity:.18;pointer-events:none}
.start-touch-hint{display:none;font-size:12.5px;color:#a99eb8;max-width:460px;margin:18px auto 0;line-height:1.5;font-style:italic}
@media (pointer:coarse){.start-touch-hint{display:block}}
```
Need `.start-controls` hidden on body.touch-mode? CSS `body.touch-mode .start-controls{display:none}` and show touch hint. Add.
- Also `body.touch-mode #toasts` should be above actions maybe top 110. Good.
- Objective toast top 58 may overlap player card; player card top 12, height ~60. Objective center top; fine.

Mobile duel UI adjustments in media:
- `#duel-ui .duel-player` top 118 left 12 width 210
- enemy top 64 width min(280,80vw)
- center msg 26px.
- `body.touch-mode #duel-ui .duel-player` maybe top 100.
- `#hud-right` top 10 scale .78. `#hud-left` scale .78.
- top-right HUD buttons 5 buttons; on mobile width: each ~30px icon = 150; fits 390. Good.
- Hide equipped-wand on mobile? It's below buttons and could overlap; set display none on max-width 820.
- Player card min width maybe; scale .78.

Add media at end for max-width 520:
```
.touch-cast-row,.touch-util-row{gap:6px}
#joystick-zone{width:clamp(92px,25vw,110px);height:...}
```
The clamp handles.

Also `#touch-controls.hidden` currently `.hidden{display:none!important}`; when touch mode remove hidden. Good.

